    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Moledown is an Up to 5 player local Multiplayer Party game, made over
        3 Months as a private Project. \n\nGamePlay: \nAll Players are Moles, and
        they must survive on an island that gets destroyed over time. to win, accumulate
        points gained via surviving.\n\nWhat I Did:\nGamedesign\nCode (All)\nArt
        (All)\nShader (All)\n\nMade with:\nC#, Unity Shadergraph, Unity\n\nNotably
        this game features marching cubes with performance enhancements via chunking
        and multi threading, to achive a very performant destructable terrain."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
